### Silicon Vertex Tracker

Slow Controls software for the SVT is being developed at the University of Washington. The power supply for each wafer must be controlled and monitored. The wafers also require temperature and bias current control and monitoring system will be similar to that of the TPC but on a smaller scale. The subsystem will communicate with the central STAR Controls via ethernet.

